        merge: (T,T) -> T, (T, merge)はモノイド
        identity: 単位元
        finalize: (T, V, V) -> T

        以下の形で書けるdpは対応可能
        dp[u,v] = finalize(merge(dp[v,k] for k in adj[v] if k != u), u, v)
        ただし(u,v)は辺
        dp[u,v]: vを根とするuを含まないような部分木についての解
        """

        dp1 = [identity] * self.n_vertices
        dp2 = [identity] * self.n_vertices

        for v in self.post_order:
            t = identity
            for u in self.children(v):
                dp2[u] = t
                t = merge(t, finalize(dp1[u], v, u))
            t = identity
            for u in reversed(list(self.children(v))):
                dp2[u] = merge(t, dp2[u])
                t = merge(t, finalize(dp1[u], v, u))
